landing), eslint under the locks. Gate 9 reads it from here on. Its unit is gate 9's,
src/features/<feature> and otherwise src/<top folder>: lib.mjs's folderOf gave only
src/<top folder>, which put every feature in one `src/features` unit that gate 9 never
looks up, so it now splits features as gate 9 does (no change on a tree without
src/features, so ratchet-base.json stands).

Gate 9's conditions: 981 warnings, 0 errors. Compared with ratchet-base.json warning by
warning (file followed through the moves, rule, message), none is new and 18 are gone:
import/no-restricted-paths 29 -> 12 (17 importers whose target moved under src/features)
and no-restricted-syntax 796 -> 795 (the notes barrel's ts-type-export warning, NotesPlace
now in features/notes/types.ts). unicorn/filename-case and every other rule: equal.

moves.tsv: move.cjs's records for commit 5 (325 `file`, 27 `delete`, NotesPlace's `name`).

